hood).</p><table-wrap id="hzt-63-07-0563-t02" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><title>Association between exposure to interparental violence in childhood and five psychosocial maladjustment outcomes in adulthood, SIRS cohort, Paris metropolitan area, 2005</title></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><colgroup span="1"><col align="left" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/><col align="center" span="1"/></colgroup><thead><tr><td rowspan="4" align="left" colspan="1"/><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Internalising disorders</td><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Intrafamilial conduct disorders</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Alcohol dependence</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Depression</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Lifetime suicide attempts</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Intimate partner violence</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Perpetrating child maltreatment</td><td rowspan="2" align="left" colspan="1">(n&#x0200a;=&#x0200a;3002)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(n&#x0200a;=&#x0200a;3011)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(n&#x0200a;=&#x0200a;3007)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(n&#x0200a;=&#x0200a;2668)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(n&#x0200a;=&#x0200a;1935)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">aOR (95% CI)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">aOR (95% CI)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">aOR (95% CI)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">aOR (95% CI)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">aOR (95% CI)</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Model 1. Baseline model</italic></td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left"